# Canonical host: force the apex, drop www.
#
# The middleware already 301s www -> apex, but scripts/finalize-routes.mjs
# excludes /{locale}/countries/* and /{locale}/cities/* from the worker so
# those ~1200 pages are served as static assets and never reach middleware.
# Cloudflare Pages evaluates _redirects at the CDN edge before routing, so
# this covers every path including the excluded ones.
https://www.slowmadly.com/* https://slowmadly.com/:splat 301
